OL,3,GNEWSAJunior chefs' award makes school
OL,4,A'incredibly proud'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA primary school is "incredibly proud"
OL,7,Fat the cooking award that three of its
OL,8,FYear 6 pupils have claimed.
OL,10,FDavide, Roxanne and Angelina from St
OL,11,FJohn Fisher Catholic Primary School in
OL,12,FOxford's Blackbird Leys won the
OL,13,Fenvironmental and sustainability
OL,14,Flearning centre Naturesbase's Primary
OL,15,FJunior Chef of the Year Oxfordshire
OL,16,F2026 award, beating about 100 schools
OL,17,Fin the county.
OL,19,FThe children impressed judges at the
OL,20,Ffinal, held at Wychwood School, also in
OL,21,Fthe city, on 2 October, with dishes
OL,22,Ffrom ingredients grown at their school.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
