OL,3,GNEWSAJunior chefs' award makes school
OL,4,A'incredibly proud'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeadteacher Paul Higgins said they
OL,7,Fwould like to cook some of the dishes
OL,8,Ffor the school community, "so that they
OL,9,Fcan taste the victory as well".
